{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/834262-what-eras-you-want-to-see-the-most-after-the-official-releases-and-why","id":834262,"title":"What eras you want to see the most after the official releases and why?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-02-20T21:59:03-08:00","id":834262,"title":"What eras you want to see the most after the official releases and why?","content":"I'm curious to know all your opinions. Once we have aeon, aberrant, and adventure what esle do you want to see? Here are my suggestions.<br /> <br /> Cold war: James bond, that's all I have to say. Paranoia, secrets, conspiracies, the fear of nuclear war, add to the mix special people and things can only get better.<br /> Victorian era: Kerberos club, if you don't know this game go ahead right know and check it, and of course the league of extraordianry gentlemen. Victorian era with superpowers, pure awesomess.<br /> First and second world wars: Godlike, another amazing game. All the drama of a great war with superpowers added to the mix. Perhaps we could have two mini supplements.<br /> Post apocalypse: I think there was mention about creating a supplement situated between aberrant and Aeon, describing a world in ruins, that would be an awesome place to visit.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2964-firanai","name":"Firanai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2964_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"672"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-21T00:40:42-08:00","id":834312,"title":"","content":"The pulpy planetary romance space opera that exists in the future of the &quot;Inspirat